%% Chunk / bucket / group claim
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> AVAILABLE
  AVAILABLE --> CLAIMED : UPDATE ... SET claim_token, claimed_by WHERE status = AVAILABLE RETURNING
  CLAIMED --> CLAIMED : heartbeat (WHERE claim_token = mine)
  CLAIMED --> COMPLETED : commit unit (WHERE claim_token = mine)
  CLAIMED --> AVAILABLE : heartbeat stale → reclaimer releases (attempt + 1)
  CLAIMED --> AVAILABLE : worker fails → releases own claim
  AVAILABLE --> DEAD_LETTERED : attempts exhausted
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  DEAD_LETTERED --> AVAILABLE : operator requeue
